# Task 145-001 Execution Plan

## Objective
Add `TimeoutConfig` interface to config-types.ts, integrate into loadConfig() 3-layer merge, create config-validator.ts with timeout-specific validation rules.

## Files to Modify
1. `src/core/config-types.ts` — Add TimeoutConfig interface + timeout field to DeckentConfig + ResolvedConfig
2. `src/core/config.ts` — Add timeout defaults to createDefaultConfig(), merge into resolved config
3. `src/core/config-validator.ts` — NEW: timeout validation rules (effort_base ordering, min/max bounds)
4. `tests/core/config-timeout.test.ts` — NEW: 4+ tests covering defaults, invalid configs, CLI set

## Approach
1. Define TimeoutConfig interface with all fields per spec
2. Add `timeout?: TimeoutConfig` to DeckentConfig
3. Add `timeout?: TimeoutConfig` to ResolvedConfig
4. Set defaults in createDefaultConfig()
5. Include in resolved output from loadConfig()
6. Create validator with 4 rules: effort ordering, min/max consistency, min >= 300, max <= 14400
7. Wire validator into validateConfig()
8. Write tests
